{"unit_id":"tag:0733:proof","translation":"这两个简单条件迫使 Leray 谱序列（spectral sequence）收敛（converge）。也可以直接证明这些事实（不使用谱序列（spectral sequence）），这是关于层（sheaves）的上同调（cohomology）的一个很好的练习。\n","allowed_english":["Leray"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"converge","target_term":"收敛"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列","context":"Leray 谱序列"},{"source_term":"converge","target_term":"收敛","context":"谱序列收敛条件"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"直接证明的练习"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0734:statement","translation":"相对（Relative）Leray 谱序列（spectral sequence）<OWNARGEND_0001>设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为赋环拓扑斯态射（morphisms of ringed topoi）。设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004>-模（module）。存在谱序列（spectral sequence），满足 <MATH_0005>，并收敛（converging）到 <MATH_0006>。这个谱序列（spectral sequence）关于 <MATH_0007> 具有函子性（functorial），并且对于有下界（bounded below）的 <MATH_0008>-模（modules）的复形（complexes），也有相应的版本。\n","allowed_english":["Leray"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Relative","target_term":"相对"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"morphisms of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"converging","target_term":"收敛"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"具有函子性"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"有下界"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Relative","target_term":"相对","context":"相对 Leray 谱序列"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列","context":"相对 Leray 比较"},{"source_term":"morphisms of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射","context":"复合推前态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"converging","target_term":"收敛","context":"谱序列极限"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"具有函子性","context":"关于系数模"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"有下界","context":"复形有界条件"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"系数复形"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0734:proof","translation":"这是函子（functors）复合（composition）的 Grothendieck 谱序列（spectral sequence），见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>，以及引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"推前函子"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"复合推前"},{"source_term":"spectral sequence","target_term":"谱序列","context":"Grothendieck 谱序列"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"章节引用"}],"notes":[]}
