{"unit_id":"tag:0735:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节在某些情形下构造基变换（base change）映射（map）；一般情形在注记 <REF_0001> 中处理。本节的讨论限制为通过平坦（flat）的赋环位点（sites）态射（morphism）进行基变换（base change）的情形，从而避免使用导出拉回（derived pullback）。在陈述结果前，先讨论导出范畴（derived category）上的平坦（flat）拉回（pullback）。假设 <MATH_0001> 是平坦（flat）的赋环拓扑斯态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>，函子（functor）<MATH_0002> 是正合的（exact）。因此它有导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0003>，只需拉回（pulling back）代表（representative）即可计算，所代表的是给定对象（object），位于 <MATH_0004> 中，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0003>。它保持有界（bounded）（上方（above）、下方（below））的子范畴（subcategories）。因此如前所述，我们用 <MATH_0005> 而不是 <MATH_0006> 来表示这个函子（functor）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_term":"pulling back","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"representative","target_term":"代表"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界"},{"source_term":"above","target_term":"上方"},{"source_term":"below","target_term":"下方"},{"source_term":"subcategories","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"平坦基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换比较"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射平坦性"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基变换态射"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回","context":"本节避免使用的操作"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"平坦拉回的定义域"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"平坦拉回"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯态射","context":"拉回态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"拉回函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合的","context":"平坦拉回正合性"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"导出函子","context":"导出平坦拉回"},{"source_term":"pulling back","target_term":"拉回","context":"拉回复形代表"},{"source_term":"representative","target_term":"代表","context":"导出对象的复形代表"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界","context":"复形有界条件"},{"source_term":"above","target_term":"上方","context":"上有界"},{"source_term":"below","target_term":"下方","context":"下有界"},{"source_term":"subcategories","target_term":"子范畴","context":"有界导出子范畴"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0736:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的交换图（commutative diagram）。设 <MATH_0002> 为有下界（bounded below）的复形（complex），其各项为 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）。假设 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005> 都是平坦的（flat）。则存在典范（canonical）基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>，位于 <MATH_0007> 中。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"有下界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"基变换图"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"有下界","context":"复形有界条件"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"系数复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"基变换态射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"比较映射的自然性"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"平坦基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换比较"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0736:proof","translation":"选取内射（injective）分解（resolutions）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002>。由引理 <REF_0001>，可知 <MATH_0003> 为内射对象（injectives）组成的复形（complex），表示（representing）<MATH_0004>。因此由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>，箭头（arrow）<MATH_0005> 在图（diagram）\n<MATH_0006> 中存在，并且在同伦（homotopy）意义下唯一（unique）。下推（Pushing down）到 <MATH_0007>，得到 <MATH_0008>。由 <MATH_0009> 与 <MATH_0010> 的伴随（adjunction），得到复形（complexes）的映射（map）<MATH_0011>。注意，这个映射（map）在同伦（homotopy）意义下唯一（unique），因为整个过程中唯一的选择是映射（map）<MATH_0012> 的选择，且一切操作都在复形（complexes）的层面进行。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"unique","target_term":"唯一"},{"source_term":"Pushing down","target_term":"下推"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"unique","target_term":"唯一"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"内射分解"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解","context":"计算导出推前"},{"source_term":"injectives","target_term":"内射对象","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"内射对象组成的复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"导出对象的代表"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"比较映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"构造图"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦","context":"比较映射的唯一性"},{"source_term":"unique","target_term":"唯一","context":"同伦意义下的唯一性"},{"source_term":"Pushing down","target_term":"下推","context":"直接像操作"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随","context":"拉回与推前"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"比较复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"比较映射"}],"notes":[]}
